[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car  on the lifting\nbridge.</p><p>Disconnect battery (-) terminal</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove handbrake guard.</p><p>1. Disconnect connection from  handbrake switch</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Handbrake switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236262\">I40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Unscrew adjustment nut (2a) and remove  check spring (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017930.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Lift the car.</p><p>1. Unscrew handbrake lever fixing screws.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017931.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<p>Lower the car.</p><p>1. Remove handbrake lever together with   handbrake switch.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017932.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Put handbrake lerver back in\nits seat together with handbrake switch.</p><p>Lift the car.</p><p>Tighten handbrake lever fixing screws to\nthe couple.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>HANDBRAKE TRAVEL</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.8 - 2.9</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Lower the car.</p><p>Assemble check spring and tighten adjustment\nnut.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238113\">3380A04</a></p><p>Reset  handbrake switch connection</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Handbrake switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3236262\">I40</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Mount handbrake guard.</p><p>Connect battery (-) terminal</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235042\">A1</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Take the car off the lifting bridge.</p>"]]